      "steps": [
        "$C\\left(-\\frac{1}{2},3\\right)=\\frac{(-1/2)(-3/2)(-5/2)}{3!}$。",
        "分子 $=-\\frac{15}{8}$，除以 6：$-\\frac{15}{48}=-\\frac{5}{16}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-\\frac{5}{16}$",
      "claim": "LIM(((1+x)^(-1/2) - 1 + x/2 - 3x^2/8)/x^3, 0) == -5/16"
    },
    {
      "title": "負整數次方",
      "prompt": "求 $\\frac{1}{(1-x)^3}$ 的 Maclaurin 級數中 $x^4$ 的係數。",
      "problemId": "uni-ser-013",
      "steps": [
        "$\\frac{1}{(1-x)^3}=(1+(-x))^{-3}$，$k=-3$，$x$ 換成 $-x$。",
        "$x^4$ 的係數 $=C(-3,4)\\cdot(-1)^4=\\frac{(-3)(-4)(-5)(-6)}{4!}=\\frac{360}{24}=15$。",
        "檢查：一般項是 $C(n+2,2)x^n$，前幾個係數 $1,3,6,10,15$，$n=4$ 時是 15。"
      ],
      "answer": "15",
      "claim": "LIM(((1-x)^(-3) - 1 - 3x - 6x^2 - 10x^3)/x^4, 0) == 15"
    }
